blend: return an error when the region of the base frame (or of its alpha channel) that a frame
blends onto lies outside the base grid, instead of panicking in MutableSubgrid::subgrid
(mutable_subgrid.rs: assertion failed: right <= self.width). Test: blend_subgrid_bounds
(crates/jxl-oxide-tests/tests/blend_subgrid_bounds.rs).

Upstream: not reported; the code is unchanged at upstream HEAD (c0cc4c7, 2026-08-15).

